course: dictionary
lesson: 8793
title: Shapeless
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Shapeless means having no clear or definite shape. Think of a blob of clay squashed in your hands, or a cloud that drifts and changes. Its outline is not neat, so you cannot call it a square, a circle or a star.
explain: The word can also describe clothes. A shapeless jumper hangs loose and baggy and does not follow the shape of the body. The words around it show which meaning fits: a jumper that hangs off you is loose, not a shape of its own.
explain: «Galaxies come in main shapes: spirals like ours, round or oval ellipticals, and shapeless irregulars.» Spirals and ellipticals have a clear pattern, but the irregulars do not. The word "main" tells you these are the three main groups, and the last group is the one with no fixed form.
fact: Shapeless means having no clear or definite shape.
fact: «Shapeless» can describe clothes that are loose and baggy and do not fit the body.
fact: A shapeless story is one that is not well organised.
fact: «Shapeless irregulars» are galaxies with no clear shape, unlike spirals and ovals.
fact: The ending -less often means without, so shape plus less means without shape.
exercise: «Galaxies come in main shapes: spirals like ours, round or oval ellipticals, and shapeless irregulars.» Which galaxies have no clear shape? | Ellipticals | *Irregulars | Spirals | Round ones
exercise: A shapeless jumper is best described as | Short and thin | Smooth and shiny | *Loose and baggy | Tight and bright
exercise: Which thing is shapeless? | A round coin | A square tile | A star cut from paper | *A lump of wet clay
test: A shapeless mass of cloud drifted over the hill. What does shapeless mean? | Very tall | Painted in bright colours | Full of birds | *Having no clear shape
test: The plot of the story was shapeless, with events jumping about everywhere. What does shapeless mean here? | *Not well organised | Clearly drawn | Funny | Very long
exam: The ghost was a shapeless figure in the fog. Which word best matches shapeless? | Loud | Clear | Bright | *Formless
